  aciklama: "1. kat, daire 2, ta\u015F\u0131nm\u0131\u015F aile (\xF6\u011Fretici).
    Ayakkab\u0131l\u0131kta tornavida; kavanoz k\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r, i\xE7inde
    Oda A'n\u0131n anahtar\u0131; Oda A'n\u0131n komodininde kat\u0131n anahtar\u0131.
    Salon, Oda B, kiler ve banyo kapal\u0131. Notlar: tahliye yaz\u0131s\u0131, kirac\u0131n\u0131n
    notu. Dekor: koliler."
